title: Change order form for roofing (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable roofing change-order form. Record tear-off layers, damaged decking, roofing materials, flashing, ventilation, the new total and both signatures. No account needed.
heading: Change order for roofing
sub: For damaged decking found during tear-off or a change in roofing material. Write down the extra work and get both signatures before it starts.
tips:
  - Name the roof section and area affected so the customer knows where the extra work will happen.
  - For damaged decking, record the location, quantity and price per sheet or square foot in the change description. Keep photos with the job record.
  - Write the roofing product and color, and describe any changes to flashing, pipe boots or ventilation.
  - Both sides sign and date it before the extra work starts. Give the customer a copy.
  - Some states have their own rules for change orders. Check with your state licensing board.
